  "title": {
    "zh-CN": "猜猜物理名词",
    "en": "Guess the Physics Word"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh-CN": "主持人心里藏着一个物理学名词，孩子用是非题来猜，猜中就升一关，从“物理小白”一路挑战到“宇宙解谜者”。",
    "en": "The host hides a physics word; the child guesses with yes-or-no questions and levels up from Physics Rookie to Cosmic Puzzle Solver."
  },
  "tags": [
    "guess",
    "physics",
    "science",
    "terms",
    "yes-no",
    "levels"
  ],
  "host": {
    "zh-CN": "谜题主持人",
    "en": "Quiz Host"
  },
  "game_zh": "猜猜物理名词",
  "subject_zh": "一个物理学名词",
  "subject_en": "a physics word",
  "subject_note": "孩子说的“它”“这个东西”“this”“it”都指谜底名词。按这个名词本身的科学含义、常见例子和日常生活里的用法来判断；是现象、力、工具、单位还是定律，也要按它的本意判断。",
  "examples_zh": [
    "它和光有关吗？",
    "它是一种力吗？",
    "它能用眼睛看到吗？",
    "它和电有关吗？"
  ],
  "examples_en": [
    "Is it related to light?",
    "Is it a kind of force?",
    "Can you see it with your eyes?",
    "Is it related to electricity?"
  ],
  "restate_zh": [
    "它和电有关吗？",
    "是，它和电有关。",
    "不是，它和电无关。"
  ],
  "restate_en": [
    "Is it related to electricity?",
    "Yes, it is related to electricity.",
    "No, it is not related to electricity."
  ],
